{"id":53157,"date":"2026-07-09T05:54:08","date_gmt":"2026-07-09T04:54:08","guid":{"rendered":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/?post_type=ajde_events&#038;p=53157"},"modified":"2026-10-01T11:20:57","modified_gmt":"2026-10-01T10:20:57","slug":"trilho-dos-arneiros","status":"publish","type":"ajde_events","link":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/eventos\/trilho-dos-arneiros\/","title":{"rendered":"Trilho dos Arneiros 2026"},"content":{"rendered":"<style>.event_description, .eventcard, .evo_eventcard, .pr-page-wrapper { height: auto !important; max-height: none !important; overflow: visible !important; }<\/style>\n<p><!-- CARD 1: DESCRI\u00c7\u00c3O GERAL --><\/p>\n<div class=\"pr-content-card\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 20px; padding: 28px; margin-bottom: 24px;\">\n<h2 class=\"pr-card-title\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-size: 22px; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 16px;\">Sobre <span class=\"pr-gradient-text\" style=\"background: linear-gradient(135deg, #C4B5FD 20%, #8B5CF6 100%); -webkit-background-clip: text; -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;\">Trilho dos Arneiros 2026<\/span><\/h2>\n<p style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.7; margin-bottom: 16px;\">O <strong>Trilho dos Arneiros 2026<\/strong> (3\u00aa edi\u00e7\u00e3o) realiza-se no dia <strong>4 de Outubro de 2026<\/strong> (Domingo), com partida e chegada no <strong>Pavilh\u00e3o Polidesportivo de Vila Nova da Rainha<\/strong>, concelho de <strong>Azambuja<\/strong>, distrito de <strong>Lisboa<\/strong>. Promovido pela <strong>Uni\u00e3o Desporto e Recreio<\/strong>, o evento est\u00e1 integrado no prestigiado <strong>Circuito do Torricado &#8211; Azambuja Trail Running<\/strong> com o apoio da C\u00e2mara Municipal de Azambuja.<\/p>\n<p style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.7; margin-bottom: 16px;\">Podes escolher entre tr\u00eas percursos desenhados pelos trilhos e manchas florestais da charneca ribatejana: o desafiante <strong>Trilho dos Arneiros de 21 km<\/strong> (partida \u00e0s <strong>09:00<\/strong>), o din\u00e2mico <strong>Mini-Trilho de 12 km<\/strong> (partida \u00e0s <strong>09:15<\/strong>) ou a relaxante <strong>Caminhada de 8 km<\/strong> (partida \u00e0s <strong>09:20<\/strong>), todos com limite de tempo generoso e postos de apoio dedicados.<\/p>\n<p style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.7; margin-bottom: 0;\">A inscri\u00e7\u00e3o inclui dorsal com chip de cronometragem eletr\u00f3nica, seguro de acidentes pessoais, abastecimentos l\u00edquidos e s\u00f3lidos de apoio e a tradicional hospitalidade da comunidade de Vila Nova da Rainha.<\/p>\n<\/div>\n<p><!-- CARD 2: FICHA T\u00c9CNICA \/ SNAPSHOT --><\/p>\n<div class=\"pr-content-card\" style=\"background: rgba(139, 92, 246, 0.06); border: 1px solid rgba(139, 92, 246, 0.25); border-radius: 20px; padding: 28px; margin-bottom: 24px;\">\n<h2 class=\"pr-card-title\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-size: 22px; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 20px;\">\u26a1 Ficha <span class=\"pr-gradient-text\" style=\"background: linear-gradient(135deg, #C4B5FD 20%, #8B5CF6 100%); -webkit-background-clip: text; -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;\">T\u00e9cnica \/ Snapshot<\/span><\/h2>\n<ul class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-grid\" style=\"display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(240px, 1fr)); gap: 16px; width: 100%; box-sizing: border-box; list-style: none; padding: 0; margin: 0;\">\n<li class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-item\" style=\"display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 4px; width: 100%; min-width: 0; box-sizing: border-box; background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.02); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.05); border-radius: 12px; padding: 14px 16px;\"><strong class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-label\" style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 12px; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.5px;\">Data<\/strong><span class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-val\" style=\"color: #F8FAFC; font-size: 15px; font